# The arcade's main boards on the replay (D201, the handoff's §3): the shelf, the
# coin pot, a make from the coin check to play, the post-game screen, a fix as a
# change, its result on the shelf, the game's card, and someone else's version.
# Run: node scripts/drive.js --script scripts/flows/arcade.drive --out DIR --replay ../../studio-kit/cli/fixtures/penguin-catch
#seed seeds/family.json
wait S1
shot S1-shelf
# The coin pot: COIN on the shelf (A1), then what it paid for (A2).
press coin
wait A1
shot A1-coin-pot
press a
wait A2
shot A2-coin-history
press esc
wait A1
press esc
wait S1
# Make a new game.
press a
wait M1
shot M1-whos-making
down a
up a
wait M3
shot M3-coin-check
# Any button but COIN does nothing here (D205).
press a
press b
wait M3
press coin
wait M4
shot M4-tell-me
say I want a game where a penguin catches fish that fall from the sky, and if you miss three fish you lose, and sometimes a boot falls and you should NOT catch the boot
down a
wait say listening
shot M5-listening
up a
wait M6
shot M6-is-this-right
press a
wait M7
shot M7-claude-asks
press a
wait question
press down
press a
wait question
press down
press down
shot M7-something-else-lit
press a
wait M8
shot M8-something-else
say slides left and right but really slippery like on ice
hold q 300
wait say confirm
press a
wait M9
shot M9-plan
press right
wait reader
shot M9-all-the-rules
press esc
wait M9
press a
wait M10
shot M10-making-it
sleep 2500
shot M10-making-it-later
wait M11
shot M11-ready
press a
wait G0
shot G0-how-to-play
press a
wait play
sleep 1500
shot G1-playing-title
press a
sleep 800
hold left 400
shot G1-playing
press esc
wait G2
shot G2-you-check-1
press down
press a
wait check
shot G2-you-check-2
press a
wait G3
shot G3-something-is-off
# Fix that: a change by the game's maker.
press a
wait R1
shot R1-whos-changing
press a
wait R3
shot R3-coin-check-change
press coin
wait R4
shot R4-what-to-change
press a
wait R5
shot R5-claude-asks
press a
wait R6
shot R6-what-changes
press a
# The name question (D471): Claude's two names, say your own, or You pick.
wait R6-name
shot R6-name-what-to-call-it
press a
wait R7
shot R7-making-faster-logs
wait R8
shot R8-faster-logs-ready
press down
press a
wait S1
shot R9-shelf-with-faster-logs
# The game's card: every version, and Change this game.
press down
press right
wait S3
shot S3-game-card
# Someone else's change is their own version (D206).
press down
press down
press a
wait R1
press down
press a
wait R2
shot R2-someone-elses-game
press a
wait R3
press coin
wait R4
press down
press a
wait R4-plan
shot R4-look-at-the-plan
press esc
wait R4
press up
press a
wait say idle
say make the boots green
hold a 300
wait say confirm
press a
wait R5
press a
wait R6
press a
wait R8
shot R8-owens-own-version
press down
press a
wait S1
press down
shot R9-shelf-with-owens-version
